{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-fa9ae4bce812e2456490c20c86e98336c30f09de2c0c1e07","family_id":"KR:012290","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Decree of the Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society","title_original":"4ㆍ16세월호참사 진상규명 및 안전사회 건설 등을 위한 특별법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"281677","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=281677","source_sha256":"ff3863dbef2b663e57c1bb50e09c12a98d7d3453e51a869f8e704412139e0470","body_sha256":"f16da39f73475257d5e29dec23f1c521d963245043a979c195a420f357de64e4","article_count":0,"full_text":"⊙ Presidential Decree No. 35948 (December 30, 2025)\n\nOrganization of the Ministry of Planning and Budget and Its Affiliated Agencies\n\n[Main text not reproduced]\n\nADDENDA\n\nArticle 1 (Enforcement Date)\nThis Decree shall enter into force on January 2, 2026: Provided, That amendments made pursuant to Article 4 of these Addenda to Presidential Decrees promulgated before this Decree enters into force but whose enforcement dates have not yet arrived shall enter into force on the enforcement dates of the respective Presidential Decrees.\n\nArticles 2 and 3 Omitted.\n\nArticle 4 (Amendments to Other Statutes)\n(1) through (135) Omitted.\n(136) The Enforcement Decree of the Special Act on Ascertaining the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safer Society is partially amended as follows:\nIn Article 5(2) and (3), \"Ministry of Strategy and Finance\" is replaced, respectively, with \"Ministry of Planning and Budget\".\n(137) through (176) Omitted.\n\n[Enactment]\n\n◇ Reasons for Enactment\n\nThe Government Organization Act was amended (Act No. 21065, promulgated on October 1, 2025 and effective from January 2, 2026) to establish the Ministry of Planning and Budget in order to strengthen the functions of balanced budget formulation and allocation and medium- and long-term fiscal strategy. Accordingly, this Decree specifies the organization, scope of duties, staffing and related matters of that Ministry.\n\n◇ Main Provisions\n\n(a) Duties of the Ministry of Planning and Budget (Article 3)\nThe Ministry of Planning and Budget shall administer matters concerning the formulation of medium- and long-term national development strategies, the formulation of fiscal policies, the formulation and execution of budgets and funds and the management of their performance, private investment, and national debt.\n\n(b) Subordinate organization of the Ministry of Planning and Budget (Articles 4 through 12)\nThe Ministry shall have a Spokesperson and Ministerial Policy Adviser; a Head of the Planning and Coordination Office and an Audit Officer; and an Operational Support Division, Future Strategy Planning Office, Budget Office and Fiscal Performance Bureau as its subordinate organization.\n\n(c) Affiliated agency of the Ministry of Planning and Budget (Articles 14 through 16)\nA Lottery Commission Secretariat shall be established under the Minister of Planning and Budget to perform duties under the Lottery Tickets and Lottery Fund Act.\n\n(d) Authorized number of public officials in the Ministry of Planning and Budget and its affiliated agency (Articles 17 and 18 and Attached Tables 1 and 2)\nThe Ministry shall have an authorized staff of 436 persons (2 political-service officials, 3 special-service officials, 16 members of the Senior Executive Service, 413 officials in Grade III or Grade IV or below, and 2 specialized career officials). Its affiliated agency shall have an authorized staff of 26 persons (1 member of the Senior Executive Service and 25 officials in Grade III or Grade IV or below).\n\n(e) Organizational units of the Ministry of Planning and Budget subject to evaluation (Article 20 and Attached Table 3)\nThe Future Strategy Planning Office, one policy-officer-level unit or equivalent in that Office, four divisions in that Office, one division in the Budget Office and two divisions in the Fiscal Performance Bureau shall be established as organizational units subject to evaluation.\n\n<Provided by the Ministry of Government Legislation>\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\decree\\en.title.json","sha256":"56a813a43d7567277deaa40162bbb7be8d7350de3f677dfba14a16c657a43c98"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\decree\\en.units.parts\\amendment-text.json","sha256":"410727b659349dbf1c384c407180b1324b8bde648f80cfb94229c9457d9318e4"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\decree\\en.units.parts\\amendment-text.selfcheck.json","sha256":"3f12ae142dd85a1dd5eee7d8aee1c97d7f1651768da634d1ac94bcd6812b82f7"},"text":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\decree\\en.units.parts\\amendment-text.txt","sha256":"087cfb6f7c2cf5c83035761a03e685477178793dee63cfbd372cf21a1398d61d"},"unit_key":"amendment-text"},{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\decree\\en.units.parts\\enactment-amendment-reason.json","sha256":"bba86672387a5a273c599f84d4efb85